{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-gs:000001:issue_created:bob-cli-gs:ac0b387b76d219d9628cd3306848095a2f21484effceb245d4c8c47cdb56166e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:26:17Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gr.land","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"bob-cli-gs","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"bob-cli-gs","title":"bob periods brief ignores done/ archive paths: archived tasks lose linked minutes and print dead source-note links","status":"open","issue_type":"task","parent_id":null,"owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-11-04T03:26:17Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gr.land","updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:26:17Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"","design":"","model":"","size":"medium","task_type":"bug","task_type_fields":{"impact":"Every weekly Review drafted from the brief inherits wrong time attribution and links that don't resolve. The bob-cli-gr phase agents had to hand-correct targets to their `done/` homes, and they left out per-task minutes. The planned Monday automation (bob-cli-gp) would hit the same problem.\n","location":"src/native/periods/brief.rs linked_minutes, linked_for, task_link","repro":"`bob periods brief 2026-W43 -f md` (also W27–W39): the bob root (5h 20m, 21%) lists no tasks, though the week's daily notes link archived rows such as `done/bob_done#^root-parent`. Finished drops archived completions (W35 `done/sase_done#^fix-startup-time`, W34 `done/sase_done#^final`), and prints dead source-note targets such as `[[sase#^add-muse-to-pools]]` (W39) and `[[sase_install#^prj]]` (W27), whose blocks now live only in `done/sase_done.md` / `done/sase_install_done.md`. Dropped prints the same dead targets (W30 `sase#^opus-5`).\n\nRoot cause: archived tasks are indexed with `source_path` = the original note and `archive_path` = the `done/` file (`src/native/stats/index.rs`). `linked_minutes` only matches a Pomodoro link target against `normalize_target(&task.source_path)`. Session links point at `done/<note>_done`, so archived tasks get 0 minutes. `done_in_span` ranks by those minutes, so `finish_cap` (7) cuts them. `task_link` always renders `stem_of(&task.source_path)`. Fix: match a link against `archive_path` too, and render `archive_path` when it is set. Do this in `linked_minutes`, `linked_for`/`task_key`, and `task_link`.\n"},"is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","creation_reason":"The bob-cli-gr phase agents drafting the W27–W43 weekly Reviews (proposed by bob-cli-gr.1 note #1, bob-cli-gr.5 note #1, bob-cli-gr.17 note #1; corroborated in gr.7–gr.14) found that the brief ignores done/ archive paths.","dependencies":[]}}}
